# X on the conversation list: the first press arms the delete and the row itself says so, the
# second asks the app to carry it out. Nothing is deleted here - the capture harness has no app
# behind it, so the clip stops where the row raises the question and where B stands it down.
scene demo
scale 4
delay 160

hold 700
key down 3
hold 500
key x
hold 1200
key b
hold 900
